  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_1294.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(27 fotos) La farmacia Serra Espad&agrave;, de la doctora Ver&oacute;nica Hern&aacute;ndez Agramut, ya ha abierto sus puertas en Onda, en la esquina con la avenida Montendre, frente al Hotel Toledo y junto a Dorotea. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_1279.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Adem&aacute;s de los servicios tradicionales de una farmacia, ofrece en exclusiva cosm&eacute;tica personalizada, tras realizar un escaner digital externo e interno de la piel de la cara. Despu&eacute;s, all&iacute; mismo preparan la receta id&oacute;nea para cada persona.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_1285.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tambi&eacute;n tiene un apartado especial de pediatr&iacute;a, con una mesita, sillas y publicaciones infantiles.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1271.jpg\" alt=\"img_1271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1272.jpg\" alt=\"img_1272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1274.jpg\" alt=\"img_1274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1275.jpg\" alt=\"img_1275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1277.jpg\" alt=\"img_1277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1279.jpg\" alt=\"img_1279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1280.jpg\" alt=\"img_1280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1283.jpg\" alt=\"img_1283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1285.jpg\" alt=\"img_1285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1286.jpg\" alt=\"img_1286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1287.jpg\" alt=\"img_1287\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1290.jpg\" alt=\"img_1290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1291.jpg\" alt=\"img_1291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1294.jpg\" alt=\"img_1294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/farmaciaserraespadaveronicahernandezagramunt/img_1296.jpg\" alt=\"img_1296\" style=\"max-width